@startuml request-patient
skinparam svgDimensionStyle false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor Black
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 25
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 80
left to right direction

rectangle "Requestor" as PatR #d5e8d4;line:82b366
actor "Patient" as PatPt
rectangle "Potential Performer A" as PatA #b1ddf0;line:10739e
rectangle "Potential Performer B" as PatB #b1ddf0;line:10739e
rectangle "Potential Performer C" as PatC #b1ddf0;line:10739e
PatR --> PatPt : 1. Propose /\nAuthorize Service
PatPt ..> PatA : 2. Patient Picks Preferred Provider\n(Obstetrician, Psychologist, etc.)
PatPt ..> PatB
PatPt ..> PatC
PatR <..> PatA : 3. Requestor and Performer share info as needed\n(could be query, could be push)
@enduml
